{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-21531","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20645","text":"The [&] Protocol Ecosystem"}]},{"id":"blk-21532","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20646","text":"This repository holds the [&] Protocol specification and every in-tree reference implementation of it, plus the portfolio products that build on top. This document is the one-page tour for someone trying to understand how the pieces fit."}]},{"id":"blk-21533","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20647","text":"For authoritative status — what's shipped, what's in progress, what the test counts are — see "},{"id":"spn-20648","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/STACK_COMPLETION.md"}],"text":"`STACK_COMPLETION.md`"},{"id":"spn-20649","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-21534","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20650","text":"The stack, in one diagram"}]},{"id":"blk-21535","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"                      ┌──────────────────────────────────────┐\n                      │   [&] Protocol — composition algebra  │\n                      │    6 primitives · 2 operators        │\n                      │    (AmpersandBoxDesign/)             │\n                      └───────────────┬──────────────────────┘\n                                      │ compiles into\n                  ┌───────────────────┴────────────────────┐\n                  │                                        │\n          ┌───────┴────────┐                      ┌────────┴────────┐\n          │   MCP runtime  │                      │  A2A coordination│\n          │   transport    │                      │    transport      │\n          └───────┬────────┘                      └─────────────────┘\n                  │\n   ┌──────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────┐\n   │              │                                           │\n   │   OS protocols (OpenSentience) — 11 normative protocols  │\n   │   OS-001 Continual Learning  → Graphonomous              │\n   │   OS-002 κ-Routing           → Graphonomous              │\n   │   OS-003 Deliberation        → Graphonomous              │\n   │   OS-004 Attention           → Graphonomous              │\n   │   OS-005 Model Tier          → (system-level)            │\n   │   OS-006 Governance Shim     → delegatic                 │\n   │   OS-007 Adversarial         → (draft)                   │\n   │   OS-008 Agent Harness       → open_sentience            │\n   │   OS-009 PRISM benchmark     → PRISM                     │\n   │   OS-010 PULSE temporal      → PULSE                     │\n   │   OS-011 Embodiment          → body-browser + body-os    │\n   └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"},{"id":"blk-21536","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20651","text":"The dark-factory closed loop"}]},{"id":"blk-21537","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20652","text":"The north-star use case for this stack is the "},{"id":"spn-20653","marks":["bold"],"text":"dark factory"},{"id":"spn-20654","text":": agents hosted on machines that operate autonomously, learn continually, and transfer skills to each other. Seven steps close the loop:"}]},{"id":"blk-21538","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │  1. Machine A perceives & acts           ←  body-browser     │\n  │                                              body-os         │\n  │  2. Records InteractionTrace             ←  Graphonomous     │\n  │     (&memory.episodic.store)                                 │\n  │                                                              │\n  │  3. Learns via memory consolidation       ←  Graphonomous    │\n  │     (consolidation, κ-routing)                               │\n  │                                                              │\n  │  4. Crystallizes to SkillCandidate        ←  FleetPrompt     │\n  │     (Crystallizer + Oban PollWorker +                        │\n  │      GraphonomousClient.HTTP)                                │\n  │                                                              │\n  │  5. Ships via FleetPrompt                 ←  FleetPrompt     │\n  │     (Registry, Trust, InstallEngine)                         │\n  │                                                              │\n  │  6. Machine B installs + replays          ←  body-browser    │\n  │     (with fresh authorization on             body-os         │\n  │      destructive edges per OS-011 §4.4)      delegatic       │\n  │                                              (authorizer)    │\n  │                                                              │\n  │  7. PRISM measures                        ←  PRISM           │\n  │     (OS-011 scenario suite,                                  │\n  │      BYOR cross-system benchmark)                            │\n  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"},{"id":"blk-21539","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20655","text":"Current status (see "},{"id":"spn-20656","marks":["code"],"text":"STACK_COMPLETION.md"},{"id":"spn-20657","text":" for always-live detail): "},{"id":"spn-20658","marks":["bold"],"text":"7 of 7 steps fully in-tree"},{"id":"spn-20659","text":". Every step has implemented code paths, passing tests, and (for the MCP-exposed pieces) deployment configs."}]},{"id":"blk-21540","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20660","text":"Product map"}]},{"id":"blk-21541","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20661","text":"Shipping products"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-21543","spans":[{"id":"spn-20662","text":"Product"}]},{"id":"blk-21544","spans":[{"id":"spn-20663","text":"Role in the loop"}]},{"id":"blk-21545","spans":[{"id":"spn-20664","text":"Transport"}]},{"id":"blk-21546","spans":[{"id":"spn-20665","text":"Test count"}]}],"id":"blk-21542","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-21547","spans":[{"id":"spn-20666","text":"Graphonomous"}]},{"id":"blk-21548","spans":[{"id":"spn-20667","text":"episodic memory + continual learning engine"}]},{"id":"blk-21549","spans":[{"id":"spn-20668","text":"MCP (stdio/HTTP)"}]},{"id":"blk-21550","spans":[{"id":"spn-20669","text":"573"}]}],[{"id":"blk-21551","spans":[{"id":"spn-20670","text":"PULSE"}]},{"id":"blk-21552","spans":[{"id":"spn-20671","text":"temporal loop manifest standard"}]},{"id":"blk-21553","spans":[{"id":"spn-20672","text":"npm package"}]},{"id":"blk-21554","spans":[{"id":"spn-20673","text":"3"}]}],[{"id":"blk-21555","spans":[{"id":"spn-20674","text":"PRISM"}]},{"id":"blk-21556","spans":[{"id":"spn-20675","text":"cross-system CL benchmark"}]},{"id":"blk-21557","spans":[{"id":"spn-20676","text":"MCP + LiveView"}]},{"id":"blk-21558","spans":[{"id":"spn-20677","text":"172"}]}],[{"id":"blk-21559","spans":[{"id":"spn-20678","text":"[&] reference"}]},{"id":"blk-21560","spans":[{"id":"spn-20679","text":"protocol spec + Elixir CLI"}]},{"id":"blk-21561","spans":[{"id":"spn-20680","text":"CLI"}]},{"id":"blk-21562","spans":[{"id":"spn-20681","text":"58"}]}],[{"id":"blk-21563","spans":[{"id":"spn-20682","text":"body-browser"}]},{"id":"blk-21564","spans":[{"id":"spn-20683","marks":["code"],"text":"&body.browser"},{"id":"spn-20684","text":" provider (OS-011)"}]},{"id":"blk-21565","spans":[{"id":"spn-20685","text":"MCP (stdio/HTTP)"}]},{"id":"blk-21566","spans":[{"id":"spn-20686","text":"41"}]}],[{"id":"blk-21567","spans":[{"id":"spn-20687","text":"body-os"}]},{"id":"blk-21568","spans":[{"id":"spn-20688","marks":["code"],"text":"&body.os"},{"id":"spn-20689","text":" provider (OS-011)"}]},{"id":"blk-21569","spans":[{"id":"spn-20690","text":"MCP (stdio/HTTP)"}]},{"id":"blk-21570","spans":[{"id":"spn-20691","text":"41"}]}],[{"id":"blk-21571","spans":[{"id":"spn-20692","marks":["bold"],"text":"delegatic"}]},{"id":"blk-21572","spans":[{"id":"spn-20693","marks":["bold"],"text":"OS-006 authorization kernel"}]},{"id":"blk-21573","spans":[{"id":"spn-20694","marks":["bold"],"text":"MCP (stdio/HTTP)"}]},{"id":"blk-21574","spans":[{"id":"spn-20695","marks":["bold"],"text":"42"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-21575","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20696","text":"Progressing products (4)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-21577","spans":[{"id":"spn-20697","text":"Product"}]},{"id":"blk-21578","spans":[{"id":"spn-20698","text":"Role"}]},{"id":"blk-21579","spans":[{"id":"spn-20699","text":"Tests"}]}],"id":"blk-21576","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-21580","spans":[{"id":"spn-20700","text":"Agentelic"}]},{"id":"blk-21581","spans":[{"id":"spn-20701","text":"spec-driven agent builder"}]},{"id":"blk-21582","spans":[{"id":"spn-20702","text":"66"}]}],[{"id":"blk-21583","spans":[{"id":"spn-20703","text":"FleetPrompt"}]},{"id":"blk-21584","spans":[{"id":"spn-20704","text":"marketplace + trust + install + crystallizer"}]},{"id":"blk-21585","spans":[{"id":"spn-20705","text":"121 (108 + 13 install tests)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-21586","spans":[{"id":"spn-20706","text":"SpecPrompt"}]},{"id":"blk-21587","spans":[{"id":"spn-20707","text":"spec-driven dev toolchain"}]},{"id":"blk-21588","spans":[{"id":"spn-20708","text":"93"}]}],[{"id":"blk-21589","spans":[{"id":"spn-20709","text":"RuneFort"}]},{"id":"blk-21590","spans":[{"id":"spn-20710","text":"spatial cognition visualization (SvelteKit)"}]},{"id":"blk-21591","spans":[{"id":"spn-20711","text":"—"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-21592","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20712","text":"Frontend apps (2)"}]},{"id":"blk-21593","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20713","text":"WebHost.Systems (React dashboard, 143 tests) and BendScript (SvelteKit KAG editor, 26 tests)."}]},{"id":"blk-21594","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20714","text":"Spec-only (5)"}]},{"id":"blk-21595","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20715","text":"AgenTroMatic (1118-line spec), Delegatic (630), Deliberatic (418), GeoFleetic (987), TickTickClock (1013)."}]},{"id":"blk-21596","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20716","text":"The three protocols in depth"}]},{"id":"blk-21597","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20717","text":"All three fit together as a three-layer stack:"}]},{"id":"blk-21598","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-21600","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20718","marks":["bold"],"text":"[&]"},{"id":"spn-20719","text":" (composition) — agents declare what capabilities they have via "},{"id":"spn-20720","marks":["code"],"text":".ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-20721","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-21599","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-21602","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20722","marks":["bold"],"text":"PULSE"},{"id":"spn-20723","text":" (temporal) — agents declare how their capabilities circulate via "},{"id":"spn-20724","marks":["code"],"text":".pulse.json"},{"id":"spn-20725","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-21601","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-21604","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20726","marks":["bold"],"text":"PRISM"},{"id":"spn-20727","text":" (diagnostic) — benchmarks measure the loops over time."}]}],"id":"blk-21603","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-21605","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20728","text":"Example: Graphonomous declares its continual-learning loop in "},{"id":"spn-20729","marks":["code"],"text":"PULSE/manifests/graphonomous.continual_learning.json"},{"id":"spn-20730","text":"; PRISM reads that manifest directly to discover phases, signatures, and substrates — no separate benchmark config needed."}]},{"id":"blk-21606","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-20731","text":"Shared infrastructure"}]},{"id":"blk-21607","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-21609","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-20732","marks":["bold"],"text":"Supabase"},{"id":"spn-20733","text":": single shared instance, "},{"id":"spn-20734","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.*"},{"id":"spn-20735","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-20736","marks":["code"],"text":"kag.*"},{"id":"spn-20737","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-20738","marks":["code"],"text":"webhost.*"},{"id":"sp